{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27289","headline":"春风扇微和 · 蒋防","name":"春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丽日催迟景，和风扇早春。\n暖浮丹凤阙，韶媚黑龙津。\n澹荡迎仙仗，霏微送画轮。\n绿摇官柳散，红待禁花新。\n舞席皆回雪，歌筵暗送尘。\n幸当阳律候，惟愿及佳辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}